# Feature ownership.
#
# Routes each PR to the person who owns that feature, so review is not a queue
# behind one person. This is the third layer of boundary enforcement — lint
# catches deep imports, CI catches new violations, CODEOWNERS makes sure the
# right human sees the change.
#
# REPLACE the placeholders below with real GitHub handles or teams before
# enabling required reviews. Unassigned features fall through to the default.

# ── Default ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                                   @Alpha-Explora/maintainers

